msgstr "書き込み処理を開始できませんでした"

#: src/bin/linux-image-writer/window.rs:1362
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Nothing was written to the USB drive.\n"
"({error})"
msgstr ""
"USB ドライブには何も書き込んでいません。\n"
"（{error}）"

#: src/bin/linux-image-writer/window.rs:1479
msgid "Writing cancelled. Nothing was written to the USB drive."
msgstr "書き込みを中止しました。USB ドライブには何も書き込んでいません。"

#: src/bin/linux-image-writer/window.rs:1659
#: src/bin/linux-image-writer/window.rs:1867
