msgstr "USB への書き込みを開始しますか？"

#: src/bin/linux-image-writer/window.rs:1684
#: src/bin/linux-image-writer/window.rs:2017
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "キャンセル"

#: src/bin/linux-image-writer/window.rs:1767
msgid "Stop Writing?"
msgstr "書き込みを中止しますか？"

#: src/bin/linux-image-writer/window.rs:1769
msgid "If you stop, the USB drive may be left with an incomplete image."
msgstr "中止すると、USB ドライブには不完全なイメージが残る可能性があります。"

#: src/bin/linux-image-writer/window.rs:1772
